 one should tell the morons that they are not ...</title><content type='html'>some one should tell the morons that they are not just facing the people who have high capacity magazines and military like weapons!!!!I don&amp;#39;t have any of them but I will stand for the rite of others to own them and I as well as many others will stand with these people and fight with them!!! if they think it will be easy to do this they better think twice about peoples neighbors shooting them in the back or the side well they are engaging on our neighbors! &lt;br /&gt;  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7662255228601938973'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7662255228601938973'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1394034179548#c7662255228601938973' title=''/><author><name>spenc</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01196374936989140517</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='21' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-jRDHR5qTRZQ/TZ00R-4Pl-I/AAAAAAAAAAc/MSd88imUBnQ/s220/m_938c24c29af0e5043e57c595f4580cb9.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2114946390"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 5, 2014 at 9:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-2103743892725435174</id><published>2014-03-05T04:04:48.827-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-05T04:04:48.827-06:00</updated><title type='text'>All I have to say is that if the posters here and ...</title><content type='html'>All I have to say is that if the posters here and the good people of CT are SERIOUS, then we had all better get organized.  All the fervent rhetoric in the world will mean nothing if the jack-booted thugs start knocking down doors and we are not ORGANIZED.  That means at least two things.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;1)  More than anything, we need a communication and notification network so that hundreds and even tens of thousands of citizens can be notified and mobilized by phone call or text in MINUTES.  This is the first thing we&amp;#39;ll need if and when it&amp;#39;s time to take serious action and respond to jack-booted thugs trying to confiscate firearms.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2)  We need to have fast response teams organized at several sizes, say 250 men, 1000 men, 20,000 men and &amp;quot;Every Man&amp;quot; (which should be millions of men), and those teams should be ready to respond in minutes.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Keep in mind that any time we respond to jack-booted thug action, our numbers need to be so overwhelming that, more than just win the immediate contest by sheer numerical intimidation, our numbers make a public statement of consensus.  Both the jack-booted thugs AND the public need to know that the responders aren&amp;#39;t just a few locals with too much time on their hands, but rather are an extremely large and determined portion of the general population.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And I want to say something that everyone should know already .... and that is you don&amp;#39;t take a gun to a &amp;quot;meeting&amp;quot; unless you&amp;#39;re willing to load it, aim it and pull the trigger.  Do you understand?  Are you willing to PULL THE TRIGGER and all that that means?  It means things like Obongo calling out the National Guard and possibly declaring local martial law.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Every man among us needs to think this through and think about the probable end game scenarios implicit in armed resistance to gov&amp;#39;t &amp;quot;authorities&amp;quot; (both political and law enforcement) who, I guarantee you, are going to conduct themselves with stunning self-righteousness and marked determination -- especially if the National Guard gets involved.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So, if we activate the network and in 20 minutes have 500 armed men surrounding a 20-man S.W.A.T team that has invaded a citizen&amp;#39;s home, ARE YOU WILLING TO AIM YOUR GUNS AT THE S.W.A.T. TEAM?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;ARE YOU WILLING TO PULL THE TRIGGER, KILL SOME MEN, AND THEN LIVE WITH THE CONSEQUENCES?  (This would be exceedingly difficult for me as I have the utmost respect for police in general and would never want to make their children orphans.  Although, S.W.A.T. teams not so much ...)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;IN THE AFTERMATH OF SUCH EVENTS, ARE YOU THEN WILLING TO &amp;quot;DOUBLE DOWN&amp;quot; AND FIGHT THE MAJOR LIBERAL MEDIA&amp;#39;S PROPAGANDA ONSLAUGHT WITH THEIR LIES, THEIR SLANDER, THEIR HALF-TRUTHS AND THEIR SINS-OF-OMISSION ALL AIMED AT MAKING YOU SEEM LESS LIKE PATRIOTIC, VIRTUOUS MINUTE MEN AND MORE LIKE HITLER&amp;#39;S BROWNSHIRTS?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;WILL YOU BE PREPARED TO &amp;quot;DOUBLE DOWN&amp;quot; AND FACE A CAMPAIGN BY THE NATIONAL GUARD AND THE POLICE TO FIND AND ARREST EVERY MAN INVOLVED IN THE INITIAL ACT OF RESISTANCE -- WHICH WILL NECESSARILY MEAN WE&amp;#39;LL HAVE TO ESCALATE OUR NUMBERS AND HOSTILITIES SUCH THAT THE GOV&amp;#39;T SUES FOR PEACE?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We can&amp;#39;t START something if we&amp;#39;re not prepared to FINISH it.  That means possibly missing weeks of work, living in hiding away from our families and homes, and who knows what else.   Are we all prepared to go where this will take us?  Are we really?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If so, somebody who&amp;#39;s smarter than I am needs to start devising a communications network and how it will work.  If we&amp;#39;re not organized and effective, we&amp;#39;re useless.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/2103743892725435174'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/2103743892725435174'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1394013888827#c2103743892725435174' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-258183943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 5, 2014 at 4:04 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1997474357100343858</id><published>2014-03-05T00:44:14.605-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-05T00:44:14.605-06:00</updated><title type='text'>oh HELL yes...&#xa;&#xa;now we need a similar list for Fai...</title><content type='html'>oh HELL yes...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;now we need a similar list for Failifornia. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;somehow, i&amp;#39;m fairly certain my would be fascist masters have subverted the law to prohibit such a list from being created. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;bastards.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.bl