.   If something bad happens, the state will have blood on their hands.  Oh and the state constitution prohibits the publishing of the names of gun owners.  You should read the constitution.  It&amp;#39;s a great document</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7261976842323512964'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7261976842323512964'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1393813687852#c7261976842323512964' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-16857799"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 8:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-2279783497865481160</id><published>2014-03-02T13:51:02.951-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T13:51:02.951-06:00</updated><title type='text'>After all legal routes have become dead ends, and ...</title><content type='html'>After all legal routes have become dead ends, and the police really do start arresting the new felons who failed to register. The list that an organized armed resistance would find most useful would be a list of state police and their home addresses.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/2279783497865481160'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/2279783497865481160'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1393789862951#c2279783497865481160' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1332152201"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 1:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-4764601947357064234</id><published>2014-03-02T13:22:02.103-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T13:22:02.103-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Ya&amp;#39;all wouldn&amp;#39;t have to be concerned about...</title><content type='html'>Ya&amp;#39;all wouldn&amp;#39;t have to be concerned about such problems and situations if Article 5 of the US Articles of Confederation had been implemented.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Another thing - don&amp;#39;t expect any relief from the SCOTUS. It is only an administrative court within the Vatican owned corporate UNITED STATES, and certainly not the Supreme Court of the Original American union.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/4764601947357064234'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/4764601947357064234'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1393788122103#c4764601947357064234' title=''/><author><name>ganid</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02425000369481234984</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1300402196"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 1:22 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-7988011624517785655</id><published>2014-03-02T12:24:08.867-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T12:24:08.867-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Santa Clause of Liberty!&#xa;You sir are the Sanity Cl...</title><content type='html'>Santa Clause of Liberty!&lt;br /&gt;You sir are the Sanity Clause of Liberty!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; Your list, you need not check it twice we know who has been naughty and now who may have to pay the price! We have witnesses throughout the land elected officials as well as others equally present with media forums, disinformation strategies, act, laws and statutes in hand, with their emotional responses to crime and punishment they are leading man’s sovereignty down a pathway to disarmament with catastrophic consequences to him and his nation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In Connecticut:&lt;br /&gt;“Thus, the court held that as long as citizens have available to them some types of weapons that are adequate reasonably to vindicate the right to bear arms in self-defense, the state can prohibit the possession of others.”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; At the end of the long road, of debate, in a final conclusion, summation the reason and sole purpose for “We the People, to keep and bear arms” is to provide the final check to a government that, from the beginning, was and is highly susceptible to the corruptions of a few unscrupulous men of power and influence [The Autocratic and Aristocratic Classes.] When such power is vested in so few representatives of the [Democratic Class] as to endanger the many, the last recourse for free men seeking to preserve their liberties becomes, force. We as a free and sovereign people can not allow any body or thing to become stronger than our ability to control that thing. The creation is not to be greater than the creator.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A reasonable standard is “If you possess it, we possess it” or the possibility of mutual pain and suffering! When the time comes that our local or state law enforcement institutions carry instruments of war, we too must collect and become proficient in whatsoever instruments that may be used against us and or endanger our liberties.&lt;br /&gt;It is they [the overlords of our liberties] that have escalated, it is they that have militarized, and it is they that have promoted fear amongst the ordinary citizens to this point of confrontation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; If it be so, that hundreds of thousands of citizens have weapons that are frowned on by some, why is it not that we have thousands upon thousands murdered each day by such weapons and the men that wield them? Because, of that multitude, only a very few a small fraction if ever cause concern or commit a crime. The count is so small in comparison to the numbers it is unworthy of such time, energy and treasure of the people involved, those resources are best focused elsewhere!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Make no mistake, the people believe in law and order; however, just as the law makers state, of our 2nd amendment Right, “this is not unlimited” so too are the limited powers granted to governments not to make whatever laws of whatever type whenever they please!&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;From a Free State, with a firm eye on what is about to happen to my fellow countrymen and their rights, as well as mine! Good Luck and may God Bless freemen everywhere!&lt;br /&gt;As God is free, so is his creation!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7988011624517785655'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7988011624517785655'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1393784648867#c7988011624517785655' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-738016675"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 12:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6166965852341889556</id><published>2014-03-02T12:09:04.957-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T12:09:04.957-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It might be a good idea to talk in more vague and ...</title><content type='html'>It might be a good idea to talk in more vague and general terms about whatever actions may or may not be taken or by who over this obvious INVASION of our Constitutionally guaranteed rights in the state of Connecticut. I guarantee you government watchdog agencies are reading every word of every post on this blog and every other blog on the internet concerning this subject. Better to gather live in like minded groups to discus ANY aspect of this subject. Recent revelations about the intelligence gathering community should send up  red flags. This, of course, is JMHO!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/6166965852341889556'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/6166965852341889556'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1393783744957#c6166965852341889556' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-636605519"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 12:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-7439211533045838120</id><published>2014-03-02T01:22:55.461-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T01:22:55.461-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I know a lot of you know this but for the newbies ...</title><content type='html'>I know a lot of you know this but for the newbies that are scared to ask how, anyone that is planning on burying their weapons, do it smartly, vertically of course in a PVC pipe with dessicant pouches or well lubed (NOT WD40-bad over time). Now the important part to thwart any police looking for it. (may as well make them work for it) One of many ideas to get you thinking but here&amp;#39;s just one--Go to a Brake center for cars. Grab a bunch of discarded brake drums, rotors, pads etc. Bury them a foot or so deep in many locations all around the yard or area you are burying the weapons. You can even choose to bury them all together as it will appear to be discarded junk when they start looking with a metal detector. All you have to do is have yours another foot or two buried below one of the items. Get a GPS app for exact location for where you buried them. Don&amp;#39;t forget, if you have small children, no need to let them know where they are now, unless they are going to be part of the revolution, IF or when it occurs, so they are not pressured out of fear to tell anyone of authority. But make sure you put those GPS locations in your Will &amp;amp; don&amp;#39;t keep that in a place to be found easily except by them. It will be like a scavenger hunt for them once your gone &amp;amp; they&amp;#39;ll have a treasure in case they need an &amp;quot;unregistered&amp;quot; one in their future!    </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7439211533045838120'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/7439211533045838120'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1393744975461#c7439211533045838120' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1239249606"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 1:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-2172623009262088522</id><published>2014-03-02T01:00:48.303-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T01:00:48.303-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If you look at what is happening in the ukrain (ou...</title><content type='html'>If you look at what is happening in the ukrain (our media won&amp;#39;t cover it, big surprise there), the politicians are being held accountable and the people are going right to them.  As in, they are no safer than the citizens they sent the police after.  In some of the other countries, civilians snipers are slowly taking out politicians that are doing illegal laws, deals and lining their own pockets at the expense of the citizens and their freedoms.  The real irony is, that 15 years ago, every media reporter would be killing themselves to be on the front lines in these countries.  Now, they won&amp;#39;t even air 30 seconds of a riot.  Personally, I support the second amendment.  It is the ONLY one that we seem to have to prove the right to use it.  The politicians are so stupid that they either mis-read (yes there are comma&amp;#39;s there for a reason) or try to re-iterate it for their own agenda&amp;#39;s.  What it&amp;#39;s going to come down to is you kick in my door, I&amp;#39;m going to call 10 people, who will each call 10 people and so on.  When you walk out my door, there will be 500 armed people there to &amp;quot;encourage&amp;quot; you to return my weapons.  That is providing I haven&amp;#39;t shot whomever kicks in my door to begin with.  I&amp;#39;m a veteran and there are many more of us, than there are of you.  And, we remember our oaths to this country.  NOT to the politicians.  A law that is unjust, may still be a law, but you also took an oath to uphold the constitution and go against such tyranny.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/2172623009262088522'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/6615644989705779752/comments/default/2172623009262088522'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html?showComment=1393743648303#c2172623009262088522' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2014/02/a-sipsey-street-public-service.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6615644989705779752' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/6615644989705779752' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1246170072"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 1:00 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-2530922960197122420</id><published>2014-03-02T00:50:29.343-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T00:50:29.343-06:00</updated><title type='text'>You should update Stephen Dargan&amp;#39;s address, th...</title><content type='html'>You should update Ste